<title>USA: Guidant add to S&amp;P Index listing delayed.</title>
<headline>Guidant add to S&amp;P Index listing delayed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bally Entertainment Corp's replacement in the S&amp;P 500 Index with Guidant Corp has been delayed, Standard &amp; Poor's equity services group said Thursday.</p>
<p>The reason is a delay in the effective date of the merger between Bally and Hilton Hotels Corp, Standard &amp; Poor's said.</p>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said it will wait for a new delisting date for Bally.</p>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's is a division of the Financial Information Services Group of the McGraw-Hill Cos.</p>
